<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Medium on 榎aaaa的个人主页</title><link>https://JiaT-T.github.io/leetcode/sliding-window/medium/</link><description>Recent content in Medium on 榎aaaa的个人主页</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://JiaT-T.github.io/leetcode/sliding-window/medium/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title/><link>https://JiaT-T.github.io/leetcode/sliding-window/medium/leetcode-sliding-window-medium/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://JiaT-T.github.io/leetcode/sliding-window/medium/leetcode-sliding-window-medium/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;#### &lt;font style="color:#DF2A3F;"&gt;第三题&lt;/font&gt;：[无重复字符的最长子串](&lt;a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/longest-substring-without-repeating-characters/"&gt;https://leetcode.cn/problems/longest-substring-without-repeating-characters/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;用到的是滑动窗口和unorder_map,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;通过两个条件限制窗口范围：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1.当（left，right）存在重复字符时，那么（left，right+1&amp;hellip;..right+n）都存在重复数值&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2.当（left，right）不存在重复字符时，那么（left+1&amp;hellip;.left+n，right）都不存在重复字符&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;因此，（left，right+1&amp;hellip;..right+n）与（left+1&amp;hellip;.left+n，right）都不需要再去进行遍历&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**核心：用unordered_map记录每个字符的出现次数**&lt;/p&gt;
